      "text": "3. The prosecution case, in short, is that on 05.06.2024, this petitioner, along with co-accused Dhawani Kumar, pulled the informant from the bus and took her towards Khagaria on his motorcycle and started pressurizing her for marriage and at around 10 PM, they raped her on the point of pistol and thereafter, it is alleged that they also assaulted informant and dropped her near her house.",
